# Repository-root build context (deploy/live/Dockerfile). Allowlist by file type: only
# the code, SQL migrations and pinned requirement files the live image needs are sent to
# the builder, so audio, models, keys, .local/, data/ and any stray file never reach an
# image layer.
*
!requirements-*.txt
!deploy/live/requirements-live.txt
!services/**/*.py
!services/store/migrations/*.sql
!models/export/*.py
!data/prepare/*.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
